{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：平安银行2Q26业绩喜忧参半-净息差超预期但非息收入仍在调整</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">平安银行<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>业绩呈现明显的两面性。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在8月14日发布的报告中指出，2Q26净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，基本符合预期，但营收低于预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。净息差环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>2个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.81%</span>，比预期高出3个基点；与此同时，不良生成率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>下半年的1.62%降至1.15%。这些数字看起来不错，但报告同时提示，逾期率和关注类贷款占比环比上升，未来几个季度的资产质量可能反复。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告的核心判断是：净息差企稳和零售<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span>是亮点，但非利息收入仍在调整、存贷款增长仍在调整、前瞻性资产质量指标出现变化，三者叠加使业绩只能算“mixed”。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>更新公司观点，没有给出更积极的结论。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUkTwbHnkhu26Tu57NkC4UR1uQw52nqhY8iaNgjQh9iaJr6MlBaT0cCyOQRn2lZKOnPSsSVVpf7StC3131iajUFcp2MfoUcVWT88E/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 净息差环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>来自负债端成本下降</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>净息差<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.81%</span>，环比上升2个基点。拆开看，资产端回报表现环比下降6个基点，其中贷款利率下降11个基点；但负债端成本环比下降8个基点，存款成本下降8个基点，同业和债券融资成本分别下降4个和5个基点。负债端的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>完全对冲了资产端的不确定性。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里的关键机制是存款成本重定价。个人定期存款成本从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.14%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.00%</span>，企业定期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.89%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.75%</span>。前期<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">降息</span>带来的存款重定价红利仍在释放，这支撑了净息差的阶段性企稳。但资产端回报表现还在节奏变化，个人贷款回报表现环比下降19个基点，这个趋势没有停。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 净息差企稳主要靠存款成本下降，不是资产端收益<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>。我的理解是，这种<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>有滞后性，存款重定价红利终会释放完毕；更值得观察的是个人贷款回报表现何时止跌，那才是净息差能否持续稳定的关键。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX7mNFgibjvjLUwkvwMTTKPTHpS7LAmwbPogwpViaNL2YjPeiaemLricz2YwbBEaODoXFFPRgO8ugy6sQVbB02tHxq9LGGFiaEVzTNg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 零售客户基础稳固但贷款增长弱于预期</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">零售条线的数据有亮点。零售客户数环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.5%</span>，零售AUM环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.6%</span>；私行客户数环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.5%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.1万</span>户，私行AUM环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.2%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.11万亿</span>元。零售贷款环比仅下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.4%</span>，好于行业平均的下降0.7%。零售不良率环比持平于1.23%，按揭和消费贷质量改善，但个人经营贷不良率环比上升11个基点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">问题出在整体规模增长。总贷款环比零增长，存款环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>，均弱于系统平均水平。企业贷款环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.2%</span>，而行业平均增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.9%</span>。存款调整主要来自零售存款环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>。零售端客户质量不错，但规模<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>仍在调整，说明居民和企业部门的融资需求仍然偏弱。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWnRNgiaIm9N6YvBXwrYt5fudBicia7lURObS7rnt5dZvJK1iaBEKbJbETQribkT09AoKAnmDgEibqsX7vE632GHCp9oj9mia9Ycx7al8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 不良生成率下降但前瞻指标连续两个季度出现变化</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">不良生成率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>上半年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.64%</span>、下半年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.62%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>上半年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.15%</span>，降幅明显。不良率环比持平于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.05%</span>，拨备覆盖率环比持平于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">219.6%</span>。单看这些指标，资产质量似乎在改善。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">但报告特别提示了两个前瞻指标的出现变化。关注类贷款占比环比上升5个基点、半年环比上升8个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.83%</span>；逾期贷款率环比上升3个基点、半年环比上升14个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.49%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>明确称这是资产质量的“red flag”。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXFG9WuJspPndR1yF9GCSsSy9UX4QxqCyVreZZtewjhayjFOBbKKWNOgv0nwr6y9IFZxzvUzMKG8sJWuha81r122LHRdTYYsqo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 28-JPM-Ping An Bank - A-000001-2Q26 result mixed- NIM beat offset by weak non-NII- asset quality mixed-260815</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
